
# 🌱社會結構(終篇)一一權力來源

## 1.結構性正當

現實的結構是「權力-信息」，凡符合這個結構的就是正當的。
①天然權力就是現實世界的本體結構，存在本身就正當。載體本身就是天然權力，載體存在，載體就具有正當性。現實結構中任何天然的存在，都是正當的（意識是外來介入者，它的正當性是例外，這裡先不談）。
②天然權力與載體具有天然同構的親和性，比如天然美帶來的生理震撼，不是人造美及人造審美能觸及的；比如健康態的本能親和，就象美一樣感覺舒適。這種生理上的親和感，就是正當性。
③載體具有生理性的「從眾/認同」本能，這是生存導向的結構策略，其初始態為融入與成為，是與環境的「一體」而非區分。這種本能認同，會以交互對象為正當，這種本能從眾會產生「回家感」。
④載體的從眾/認同就象一個閥門，成為意識介入的開關，意識驅動開關進行的交互，載體會覺得「這就是我本體」的行為，意識從而獲取載體的認同，即具有正當性，這是一種寄生：借殼的正當性。
⑤歷史已反覆驗證，守信對於載體尤為重要，並且，在物理現實中，是不存在意識中的謊言狀態的，守信更是一種天然親和的生理結構；因此，敘事必須要守信也是極其重要的正當性來源。

對於外來介入者的意識而言，首先載體是它唯一顯化途徑，因此它需要獲取正當性以驅動載體；其次虛構敘事是它驅動載體的唯一方式，因此它需要編故事講故事。所以呢，意識就需要編造出具有正當性的故事講給載體聽。
①最優策略：模仿物理現實的天然權力，以天然權力的正當性為原型敘事，這樣「仿真」與「篡位」，最易獲載體認同。例如人權敘事就是宣稱「與生俱來」的天然存在性，再比如神權敘事就是在以神為天然至高存在——天然權力為正當性；
②模仿出一個一模一樣的物理世界，這不僅會讓生成的社會結構具有載體親和性，更重要的是還要與物理現實對齊，免得載體神精錯亂。因此社會權力與天然權力就須具有完全同構的特征。
顯然，正當性敘事，是關乎意識存在的頭等大事，是關乎社會存亡的頭等大事，是貫穿整個社會全過程的永恆主題；而不斷變換外衣（主義、口號、制度）就成為敘事的主旋律。

當今敘事已不擇手段，政治、宗教、道德、國家都以意識型態的主觀意志為標準，尤其是在技術加速下越發覺得天然權力可以被踐踏。而科學敘事是唯一一個不試圖隱瞞天然權力，反而致力於解碼天然結構的敘事，它與物理結構的耦合度最高，能直接與物理規律對齊，減少敘事摩擦。這也是科學敘事可以跨國界、跨種族而被廣泛認同的原因：它是最接近「天然」的敘事。
而科學主義「救世/進步」的烏托邦，不是科學。

## 1.Legitimacy

The structure of reality is “Quanli-Information,” and anything that conforms to this structure is inherently legitimate.
① Tianran Quanli is the ontological structure of the real world; its very existence is legitimate. The carrier itself is Tianran Quanli; as long as the carrier exists, it possesses legitimacy. Any natural existence within the real structure is legitimate (consciousness, as an external intervener, is an exception and is not discussed here).
② Tianran Quanli possesses natural structural affinity with the carrier. For example, the physiological shock evoked by natural beauty cannot be replicated by artificial beauty or man-made aesthetics; health's instinctive affinity feels comfortable in the same way as beauty. This physiological affinity is legitimacy itself.
③ Carriers possess the physiological instinct of “conformity/identification,” a survival-oriented structural strategy whose initial state is integration and becoming — oneness with the environment rather than differentiation. This instinctive identification treats the interactive object as legitimate; this instinctive conformity produces a “homecoming” feeling.
④ The carrier's conformity/identification functions like a valve, serving as the switch for consciousness's intervention. When consciousness drives interactions through this switch, the carrier perceives the behavior as “this is my own body,” granting consciousness the carrier's identification — thus legitimacy. This is a form of parasitism: legitimacy borrowed through the shell.
⑤ History has repeatedly verified that credibility is particularly important to carriers. In the physical real world, there is no state of conscious lies — credibility is a naturally affinitive physiological structure. Therefore, narrative credibility is also an extremely important source of legitimacy.

For consciousness as an external intervener, the carrier is its only pathway to manifestation, so it must first acquire legitimacy to drive the carrier. Second, fabricated narrative is its only means of driving carriers, so it must weave and tell stories. Therefore, consciousness needs to fabricate stories with legitimacy to tell to carriers.
① Optimal strategy: imitate Tianran Quanli of physical reality, using its legitimacy as the prototype for narrative. Through such “simulation” and “usurpation,” it most easily gains carrier identification. For example, human rights narratives claim “innate” natural existence; divine right narratives position God as the supreme natural existence — Tianran Quanli as legitimacy.
② Imitating an identical copy of the physical world not only gives the generated social structure carrier affinity, but more importantly, it must align with physical reality to avoid mental derangement. Therefore, social Quanli and Tianran Quanli share completely isomorphic characteristics.
Evidently, legitimacy narrative is the foremost matter concerning the existence of consciousness, the foremost matter concerning the survival of society, and the eternal theme running through the entire process of society; constantly changing the outer garment (ideologies, slogans, institutions) becomes the dominant melody of narrative.

Contemporary narratives have become unscrupulous: politics, religion, morality, and nations all take subjective ideological will as standard, especially under technological acceleration, increasingly believing Tianran Quanli can be trampled. Scientific narrative is the only one that does not attempt to conceal Tianran Quanli but instead devotes itself to decoding the natural structure. It has the highest coupling with physical structure, directly aligning with physical laws and reducing narrative friction. This is also why scientific narrative can be widely accepted across borders and ethnicities: it is the narrative closest to “the natural.”
Yet the utopian “salvation/progress” of scientism is not science.

